WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.020
The first thing when you get involved in these issues is the industry and the agencies didn’t want to hear from the community.

2
00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:17.000
They treated them as hysterical housewives, raving idiots, not a clue about what was going on.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.280
“How dare these people come in here and tell us how we should be doing our job?

4
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:27.380
And how dare they think that we’re going to accommodate them when we’re trying to do our job?”
